WEBVTT

00:10:58.287 --> 00:11:00.890
and you have overall poor judgment.

00:11:00.914 --> 00:11:04.001
But my friends,
it's so much worse than that.

00:11:04.025 --> 00:11:06.072
(Laughter)

00:11:06.096 --> 00:11:08.056
If you are a tired brain,

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:11.016
the brain is craving things to wake it up.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:13.206
So drugs, stimulants.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:16.900
Caffeine represents
the stimulant of choice

00:11:16.924 --> 00:11:18.504
across much of the Western world.

00:11:18.528 --> 00:11:20.551
Much of the day is fueled by caffeine,

00:11:20.575 --> 00:11:23.589
and if you're a really naughty
tired brain, nicotine.

00:11:23.613 --> 00:11:26.906
Of course, you're fueling the waking state
with these stimulants,

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:29.366
and then, of course, it gets
to 11 o'clock at night,

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:30.778
and the brain says to itself,